regress\artifacts\lcabadval\grok_design_20260907.txt:135:A detector that only writes the six currently-legal constants is green under **verbatim reinstatement of all six original guards**. That is the vacuity-floor miss. The rows that make (b) bite are the documented-rejected writes (MASK0 `0`, BASE1 with WEN clear, CONF bit 32, a non-TEN TB_ENA bit).
