regress\artifacts\sgimtedepth4dead\panel_p2_20260907\grok.txt:1:I'll audit the packet against the tree rather than ratify it: the product hunk, the 13-row detector, and the eight mutants, starting with the source and probe.The brief forbids `regress/artifacts/`; I'll stay in source and the probe. Next I'll read the transfer, GET/PUT arms, and the 13-row detector.The copy-row gate looks coupled to the fill session; I’ll confirm endianness, the product diff, and whether `>= 32` really escapes.**VERDICT: NOT RATIFY.** The product token `depth == 32` is the right one-character repair. The 13-row instrument is not: three copy/fill rows are described as one gated form and they are not, M4 is filed as clause (d) and it is not, and section 5 is missing two cells the eight-mutant table itself makes visible. Do not drop the three gated rows. Do not ship the packet’s description of them.
